//!
//! Residual risk and notes (see also login-link/README.md):
//! - Identity: the holder key, the same in every app. The issue time is holder-stated, and the POD has no expiry, so a
//!   revoked ticket still links.
//! - A raw `signPODRoot` signer, or an app API that signs app-chosen entries, is a login oracle: holder software must
//!   not sign `_aztec_link_v1_` PODs for another party.
